  "text": "Miami, Florida - U.S.A.\nEnglish\nEspañol\nРусский\nAbout us\nAreas of practice\nPeople\nNews & Articles\nOffices\nContact\nAttorneys & Counselors North America\nReach, experience and acute know-how are the hallmarks of Diaz Reus international attorneys. From our Miami, Florida headquarters and offices around the world, Diaz Reus attorneys help companies, government entities and individuals transact business and resolve disputes at home and abroad.\n\n“Their main strength is the way they manage the relationship with clients, establishing a mutual confidence in order to understand the problems and focus on the best solution.”\n\n- Chambers USA\n\nNorth America\nLatin America\nEurope\nMiddle East & Asia\nDiaz Reus international offices in key business centers offer legal services in North America, Latin America, Europe, Asia and the Middle East. Diaz, Reus & Targ LLP is an international legal practice providing client services worldwide through its member firms and affiliates. Any reference to a “partner” means a person who is a partner, member, consultant, or employee with equivalent standing and qualifications in one of Diaz Reus’ member firms or affiliates.\nUnited States of America\nMiami, Florida - Washington, D.C. - Los Angeles, California - New York, New York - Houston, Texas\nDiaz, Reus & Targ LLP is an international legal practice providing client services worldwide through its member firms and affiliates. Any reference to a “partner” means a person who is a partner, member, consultant, or employee with equivalent standing and qualifications in one of Diaz Reus’ member firms or affiliates.\nCanadá\nToronto - Ontario\nDiaz, Reus & Targ LLP is an international legal practice providing client services worldwide through its member firms and affiliates. Any reference to a “partner” means a person who is a partner, member, consultant, or employee with equivalent standing and qualifications in one of Diaz Reus’ member firms or affiliates.\nHeadquarters:\nMiami Tower at International Place\n100 S.E. Second Street, Suite 3400\nMiami, FL 33131\n+1 . (877) . 247 . 92 . 77\n+1 . ( 305 ) . 375 . 92 . 20\ninfo@diazreus.com\nUSA & Canada\nMiami, Florida\nWashington, D.C.\nLos Angeles, California\nNew York, New York\nHouston, Texas\nToronto, Canada\nLatin America\nBelo Horizonte\nBogota, Colombia\nBonaire\nBuenos Aires, Argentina\nCaracas, Venezuela\nCuraçao\nLima, Peru\nMexico City, Mexico\nOranjestad, Aruba\nPanama, Republic of Panama\nSantiago, Chile\nSanto Domingo, DR\nSao Paulo, Brasil\nGuatemala, Guatemala\nMonterrey, Mexico\nUberlandia\nWillemstad, Curaçao\nEurope\nAthens, Greece\nFrankfurt, Germany\nMadrid, Spain\nMoscow, Russia\nMykonos, Greece\nNicosia, Cyprus\nPrague, Czech Republic\nMiddle East & Asia\nAbu Dhabi, United Arab Emirates\nAleppo City, Syria\nAmman, Jordan\nBagdhad, Iraq\nBeirut, Lebanon\nDubai, United Arab Emirates\nLahore, Pakistan\nRiyadh, Saudi Arabia\nShanghai, China\nAfrica\nJohannesburg, South Africa\n© 2026 DIAZ REUS, LLP. All rights reserved.\nDisclaimer",
